{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "7792822585f01b0b0d450a690e53c61fe2c3a86a879ed61d3e4901d3d44b4aba", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお待ちしてました！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我一直在等您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a8dd8d43a8591e245d7faa4f24a0b389aeff8cd77bdbcf183385d0f42a724b5e", "ja": "青羽さん、お待たせしてすみません！\n資料やら持ち物を見直していたら、時間が……。", "zh": "青羽小姐，让您久等了，真是不好意思！\n我重新确认了资料之类的东西，还有要带的物品，结果就耽搁了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "12d3ff182332ec3f36fe79b16ff1dddd7825f62e242ffff6e58d3bd23ed7cdd1", "ja": "ふふっ、ライブ出発前ってなんだかワクワクして、\nそうなっちゃいますよね。わかります♪", "zh": "呵呵，演唱会出发前总会让人莫名兴奋，不知不觉就会这样呢。我懂的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9160cf35c6907bba033b49191ec594e3c6b76231e036ae7e01679dcc1c28a521", "ja": "でも、もう大丈夫です！\n準備は万全ですから、現場に向かいましょう！", "zh": "不过，已经没事了！\n准备万全，我们出发去现场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1006_president", "source_sha256": "1945abe4a656d1555a40ddaa4ff1532f1873dfe3daf208cd561f2d86468dcdb8", "ja": "やあ君！　私よりも遅い登場とは……\n重役出勤というやつだね！　はっはっは！", "zh": "哎呀你来啦！居然比我还晚登场……\n这就是所谓的高管迟到做派吧！哈哈大笑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4860196ee375830b66a3d11a5a591f884e3cb631174906d7cf304fe3a68266ae", "ja": "す、すみません！　準備に手間取ったり\nいろいろと挨拶まわりもありまして……！", "zh": "对、对不起！准备工作花了点时间，而且还得去各处打招呼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "e6eeb1161541cf68d674c57151185b1f4fe4d3ce367fb884958f4f5b2e1f89ce", "ja": "社長、私達だってついさっき来たばかりでしょう？\n出発前は準備に大慌てしていたくせに……。", "zh": "社长，我们自己也是刚刚才到的，不是吗？\n出发前还慌慌张张地准备来着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "58c7aac99f03502d799bb37ec71948773a8b49b224e9366bd7f84dea64fb9b55", "ja": "お、音無君！？　困るよ、そういうことは\n秘密にしておいてくれないと……！", "zh": "哦、音无！？这种事可不能说出来啊，得替我保密才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "bb59477e11199068d94fa9d0a225f97603e4e2188beda7e6d6f30ac0d5b5e2f4", "ja": "ふふっ。社長さんたちも、\nワクワクしてたんですね♪", "zh": "呵呵。原来社长他们也在期待着呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "09fdc35f88625e3ef030d19de881e3feecd29dfe05679b17c0a4902e091edbcf", "ja": "ええ。ライブは何度も応援に来てるはずなのに、\nおかしいわね。でも、いつもそうなの。", "zh": "是啊。明明应该已经来现场给你们加过很多次油了，\n真奇怪呢。不过，我每次都是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "05610b8ef17d7bfab5e6bae650d31cb9148e4a55bb9c32a01a067bbdf5f81fda", "ja": "ステージに立つ13人を見るたびに、\nドキドキして、胸が高鳴って……。", "zh": "每次看到站在舞台上的13个人，\n我都会心跳加速，心潮澎湃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bcd6be0ef0f236be5275197437b17fa3d52bad405d13fe3571ecaf9e450faa0c", "ja": "そんな胸のときめきを、ワクワクを、彼女たちは\nこれまでずっと届けてきてくれました。", "zh": "这样的心动与雀跃，她们一直以来都为我们带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c433c5b4d30a01bb833cf798bc824ac52b687f99a0be5ebace6e6d5dd80013fc", "ja": "そして……これからもです！", "zh": "而且……今后也会继续带来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "c42bc2f13be8c1e3ccecbd22d738f694474ba85794d018251d5f2aa291a750a8", "ja": "その通りだ！　今、最高点の輝きを見せて、\nそしてまた新たな輝きに向かっていく……。", "zh": "没错！现在展现登峰造极的光辉，然后再朝着全新的光辉前进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "f625764d12493a4f9318fa6e408827114181129dcd4f818e493ce7b4c97d89e5", "ja": "見届けさせてもらおう！\n765PRO ALLSTARSの、色あせることない輝きを！", "zh": "让我来见证吧！\n765PRO ALLSTARS永不褪色的光辉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_intro_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "625aede2d6a5f1501795a64e1f81b795ab6c95af80ce4ad5a6721c6cf50a2dc0", "ja": "みなさん、こんにちは～！\n私たち……", "zh": "大家，中午好～！\n我们是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
